{"contents":[{"parts":[{"text":"Calculate 23 * 17. Show your work."}],"role":"user"},{"parts":[{"text":"To calculate **23 × 17**, you can use several methods. Here are two ways to show the work:\n\n### Method 1: Standard Long Multiplication\n1.  **Multiply 23 by 7 (the units place):**\n    *   7 × 3 = 21 (Write **1**, carry the **2**)\n    *   7 × 2 = 14. Add the carried 2: 14 + 2 = 16.\n    *   Result: **161**\n\n2.  **Multiply 23 by 10 (the tens place):**\n    *   Place a **0** in the units column as a placeholder.\n    *   1 × 3 = 3\n    *   1 × 2 = 2\n    *   Result: **230**\n\n3.  **Add the two results together:**\n    *   161 + 230 = **391**\n\n***\n\n### Method 2: The Distributive Property (Mental Math)\nYou can break 17 into (10 + 7):\n*   23 × 10 = 230\n*   23 × 7 = (20 × 7) + (3 × 7) = 140 + 21 = 161\n*   230 + 161 = **391**\n\n***\n\n### Method 3: Difference of Squares (Shortcut)\nSince 23 and 17 are both 3 units away from 20, you can use the formula $(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - b^2$:\n*   (20 + 3)(20 - 3)\n*   $20^2 - 3^2$\n*   $400 - 9 = \\mathbf{391}$\n\n**Final Answer:**\n23 × 17 = **391**","thoughtSignature":""}],"role":"model"},{"parts":[{"text":"Now divide that result by 23"}],"role":"user"}],"generationConfig":{"candidateCount":1,"maxOutputTokens":1024},"safetySettings":[{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_DANGEROUS_CONTENT","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"},{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_HARASSMENT","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"},{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_HATE_SPEECH","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"},{"category":"HARM_CATEGORY_SEXUALLY_EXPLICIT","threshold":"BLOCK_NONE"}]}HTTP/2.0 200 OK
